igma_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I\">\\(\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I\\)</span> 为其中分量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_d\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_d\\)</span> 为本页定义的兼容函子名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_d\\coloneqq\\Sigma_d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_d\\coloneqq\\Sigma_d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧投影记号由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\pi_X\">\\(d=\\pi_X\\)</span> 取得；结构参数是同一共享基底上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,D_\\chi\">\\(q,D_\\chi\\)</span>，不再混用底层类型族与谓词纤维。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-exists]]；假设 $\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)$ 并固定其同一伴随族。$d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi$，$\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I$ 为其中分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\chi=\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepExists}(q,D_\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"d:A\\to I\\in D_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_d:\\mathcal P_A\\to\\mathcal P_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_d","d